strict reads no environment variable and opens no file, and every limit is set low
so each one can be shown going over.

Usage:
  strict [command]

Available Commands:
  big         A command with too much to say
  completion  Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
  getter      Show the try getters handing back errors
  help        Help about any command
  nest        The second level
  refuse      Show a strict tree refusing every binding
  show        Print every flag and where its value came from

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for strict

Use "strict [command] --help" for more information about a command.
